- New static/css/deadlines-jarvis.css (scoped to data-odx-theme="jarvis",
  linked after the inline sheet like /cases): glass header with core +
  tracked wordmark and mono nav keys; chamfered summary readouts (amber
  only when overdue, zeros dim); chamfered rows with a status rail, fixed
  status column (tag + countdown), ticked pending spine, green confirm key;
  brightest frame on the ?item= row; amber notice rail; glass toast.
- Phones (jarvis): keep a "‹ Chat" key — the inline sheet hid the whole
  nav ≤520px, leaving no way back to the app.
- deadlines.html: aria-hidden .eta countdown + .zero stat class from the
  page script; .eta is display:none in the inline sheet, so other themes
  render pixel-identical (verified).
- Reduced motion / contrast / transparency / forced-colours gates.
- docs/JARVIS_UI.md Run 24, ROADMAP.

