+### Run 24 — 2026-11-09 · `/deadlines` page
+New `static/css/deadlines-jarvis.css`, linked after the page's inline
+`<style>` in `static/deadlines.html` (same pattern as `/cases`: every rule
+scoped to `:root[data-odx-theme="jarvis"]`, own `@font-face` for Inter /
+Fira Code since the page doesn't load the app's sheets).
+- **Before:** jarvis colours only — rounded system-font cards, a 2-tone
+  summary, titles misaligned by tag width (OVERDUE vs DUE SOON), header
+  wordmark in the fallback mono, and **no way back to the app on phones**
+  (the inline sheet hides `header nav` ≤520px).
+- **Header:** dark glass + neon bottom edge, living core diamond + tracked
+  wordmark (the page's only infinite animation); nav = mono keys, first one
+  "‹ Chat". ≤520px jarvis keeps that one key (44px). `scroll-padding-top`
+  keeps a `?item=` row clear of the sticky header.
+- **Summary:** three chamfered instrument readouts — mono micro-label over a
+  32px mono figure. Overdue > 0 is the only amber surface (line, ticks,
+  figure); a zero dims to `--jv-text-faint` (`.zero` class added in JS —
+  no rule outside jarvis).
+- **Rows:** the `/cases` frame recipe (45° chamfers, drawn diagonals,
+  ticks) + a 2px status rail (amber overdue / cyan due soon / faint held).
+  Fixed 96px status column: tag chip + a countdown readout `.eta`
+  ("4D LATE", "24H LATE", "2D TO GO", "3D UNTIL BACK"; hours under 36h).
+  `.eta` is new markup from `eta()` in the page script, `aria-hidden`
+  (the meta line already says it in words) and `display:none` in the
+  inline sheet, so other themes don't see it. Source = outlined mono chip;
+  pending items hang off a hairline spine with ticks; actions sit under a
+  faint rule — green confirm key, then the snooze cluster.
+- **Focus row** (`?item=`): bigger chamfer + ticks at full cyan-hi (amber
+  if overdue), a one-shot brightness "lock" (no glow box).
+- **Empty / notices:** idle core above "Nothing overdue…"; the ">30 days
+  overdue" line is an amber attention rail, not a dashed empty box. Toast =
+  chamfered glass slab with a cyan (or danger) rail.
+- **Phones:** status column folds into one line (tag left, countdown
+  right) above the title; keys stay 2-up at 44px.
+- **Type:** tabular figures only on data (summary, countdown, meta, toast)
+  — Inter's `tnum` also widens hyphens in prose.
+- **Prefs:** reduced motion kills every jarvis animation (probe: 0 running
+  vs 1 core); `prefers-contrast: more` zeroes glow + brightens hairlines;
+  reduced transparency drops blur + grid; forced colours drop chamfers and
+  pseudo frames for plain borders.
+- Verified headless (mocked `/api/deadlines`, nonce injected): full list
+  (overdue, due soon, snoozed, done, long-overdue notice, `?item=` focus),
+  empty state and snooze toast, jarvis + light at 1440×900 and 390×844.
+  Light before/after **pixel-identical** in all four scenes. No page or
+  console errors. Deadline + static-mime + theme CSS tests: same pass/fail
+  as baseline (2 route tests fail on missing fastapi).
+
+**Next:** light-theme contrast/overlap report (Runs 19–23 notes) for the
+preset owner; then the Services window in the same frame language.
